# B35 Lane B package-local EOL policy (CENTRAL G3 hash-portability fix).
#
# Hashed text artifacts must materialize as byte-identical LF in ANY fresh
# checkout (Windows/Linux, regardless of core.autocrlf), so manifest
# OUTPUT_HASHES computed over raw worktree bytes stay valid after checkout.
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
validation/*.py text eol=lf

# Binary artifacts: never undergo EOL conversion.
*.pptx -text
*.docx -text
*.xlsx -text
*.pdf -text
*.png -text
